; MoneyTracker sample vault — every transaction here is plain hledger syntax.
;
; `rules.ledger` is read by MoneyTracker only and is deliberately NOT included
; here: transactions are expanded when they are written, so an external
; `hledger -f index.ledger balance` sees the same numbers as the app.

commodity 1,000.00 CNY

include accounts.ledger
include prices.ledger
include budgets.ledger
include 2026/2026.ledger
